                                     No. 25-3141-pr



                       RICARDO APARECIDO BARBOSA DA CUNHA,


                                   Petitioner-Appellee,
                                             v.
    JOSEPH E. FREDEN, Deputy Field Office Director, U.S. Immigration and Customs
                                      Enforcement,


