5:10312 Federal Register / Vol. 62, No. 44 / Thursday, March 6, 1997 / Rules and Regulations
6-DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE
7-Immigration and Naturalization Service
8-Executive Office for Immigration Review
9-8 CFR Parts 1, 3, 103, 204, 207, 208, 209, 211, 212, 213, 214, 216, 217, 221, 223, 232, 233, 234, 235, 236, 237, 238, 239, 240, 241, 242, 243, 244, 245, 246, 248, 249, 251, 252, 253, 274a, 286, 287, 299, 316, 318, and 329
