1039-(iv) Bearers of Mexican diplomatic or official passports described in § 212.1(c– 1) of this chapter. (2) Paroled aliens. Any alien paroled into the United States under section 212(d)(5) of the Act, including any alien crewmember, shall be issued a completely executed Form I–94, endorsed with the parole stamp.
